 610:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                      ##### DATA EEPROM Programming functions ##### 
 611:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 612:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****  
 613:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****     [..] Any operation of erase or program should follow these steps:
 614:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****     (#) Call the HAL_FLASHEx_DATAEEPROM_Unlock() function to enable the data EEPROM access
 615:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         and Flash program erase control register access.
 616:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****     (#) Call the desired function to erase or program data.
 617:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****     (#) Call the HAL_FLASHEx_DATAEEPROM_Lock() to disable the data EEPROM access
 618:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         and Flash program erase control register access(recommended
 619:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         to protect the DATA_EEPROM against possible unwanted operation).
 620:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** 
 621:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** @endverbatim
